        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "乳形六格：长乳、短乳、大乳、小乳，这四种是正格；双垂乳、三垂乳，这两种是变格。",
        "confidence": "high",
